# 05-ai.mdc

AI feature guidance (insights, summaries, assistant outputs).

- Build exactly one AI product feature: market insight over price/time data.
- Use Gemini through `google-genai` only; model is `gemini-3.5-flash` (see `backend/ai/insight_engine.py`).
- Do not install or use the legacy `google-generativeai` package.
- Keep `GEMINI_API_KEY` server-side; never expose it through Vite.
- Prefer structured JSON output with a schema.
- Keep model prompts versioned and traceable.
- Never trust model output without validation for user-visible claims.
- Isolate AI inference in `backend/ai/insight_engine.py`.
- Gate expensive generation behind explicit triggers.
- Record enough context to debug prompt/response quality over time.
- Send demo market data only; do not send sensitive user data.
